{'symbol': 'ORLY', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:30:00', 'title': "O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND\xa0FULL-YEAR 2022 RESULTS", 'text': "SPRINGFIELD, MO., FEB. 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. (THE “COMPANY” OR “O'REILLY”) ( NASDAQ: ORLY), A LEADING RETAILER IN THE AUTOMOTIVE AFTERMARKET INDUSTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED RECORD REVENUE AND EARNINGS FOR ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR ENDED DECEMBER\xa031,\xa02022. THE RESULTS REPRESENT 30 CONSECUTIVE YEARS OF COMPARABLE STORES SALES GROWTH AND RECORD REVENUE AND OPERATING INCOME FOR O'REILLY SINCE BECOMING A PUBLIC COMPANY IN APRIL OF 1993."}